00:07:34.696 --> 00:07:36.129
THEY SCREAM RACISM AND HOPE THAT

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:38.999
NATIONALISM WILL GO AWAY.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:41.401
WILL IT GO AWAY?

00:07:41.402 --> 00:07:42.202
PROBABLY NOT.

00:07:42.203 --> 00:07:44.004
BECAUSE THE CORE IDEA IS

00:07:44.005 --> 00:07:46.239
APPEALING TO PEOPLE, ALL PEOPLE

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.342
