00:07:48.343 --> 00:07:49.876
PEOPLE WANT LEADERS WHO ARE

00:07:49.877 --> 00:07:51.411
ABOVE ALL ON THEIR SIDE.

00:07:51.412 --> 00:07:53.046
THEY ALWAYS HAVE WANTED THAT AND

00:07:53.047 --> 00:07:55.048
THEY ALWAYS WILL WANT THAT.

00:07:55.049 --> 00:07:56.016
THAT'S WHAT WE KNOW.

00:07:56.017 --> 00:07:57.584
WHAT WE DON'T KNOW IS WHAT'S

00:07:57.585 --> 00:07:59.786
GOING TO HAPPEN IN THE ELECTIONS

00:07:59.787 --> 00:08:01.656
TOMORROW.

